# fable5-gpt5.6 — the DEFAULT Fusion harness (Fable 5.1 + GPT-5.6 Sol era, September 2026).
#
# Cross-model panel: one Claude Fable 5.1 + one GPT-5.6 Sol (codex), each answering blind — two model families,
# maximum diversity per panelist. A fresh blind Fable 5.1 subprocess judges the anonymized answers; the
# Fable 5.1 session synthesizes. This preset matches what detect_panel.sh recommends with no variant set
# (when the codex CLI is present) — it exists so the live default harness has a name, a file, and a
# template to copy when the next model era arrives.
#
# Opus 4.8 is NOT in this panel: it is the FALLBACK second panelist, used automatically when codex/GPT-5.6
# is unavailable (see detect_panel.sh) or explicitly via the fable5-duo preset / /fusion-fable5.
#
# Presets assign DEFAULTS (:=), so any var you export explicitly still wins.
: "${FUSION_PANEL:=fable5,gpt5.6}"
: "${FUSION_JUDGE:=fable5}"
: "${FUSION_CLAUDE_MODEL:=claude-fable-5-1}"
: "${FUSION_OPUS_MODEL:=opus}"
: "${CODEX_PANELIST_MODEL:=gpt-5.6-sol}"
: "${JUDGE_MODEL:=gpt-5.6-sol}"
